6. INSURANCE RESPONSE & CLIENT RETAINED LOSS
==============================================================================
   Current program: $25M limit / $1M retention / $25M aggregate
   SECTION 1 -- GROUND-UP CYBER LOSS (before insurance):
     EAL  : $5.45M
     VaR99: $45.57M
     ES99 : $72.30M
     P99.9: $110.17M
   SECTION 2 -- INSURANCE RESPONSE:
     Policy limit   : $25.00M
     Retention      : $1.00M
     Covered loss   : $2.32M (transferred EAL)
     Insurer payment: $2.32M
     P(annual limit exhausted) : 1.74%
   SECTION 3 -- CLIENT RETAINED LOSS:
     Retained EAL  : $3.12M
     Retained ES99 : $47.39M
     For a $110.17M extreme loss event:
       Client retention        : $1.00M
       Insurance recovery      : $25.00M maximum
       Residual uncovered      : $84.17M
     -> The $25M limit covers $72.30M of the 1-in-100 tail, but a
        P99.9 event ($110.17M) leaves $84.17M the client retains after insurance.

